## Module Responsibilities

| Module | Endpoints | Key Functions |
|--------|-----------|---|
| **auth** | `/api/login`, `/api/register`, `/api/logout` | User authentication, session management |
| **members** | `/api/members`, `/api/members/<id>/project-roles` | CRUD members, get project assignments |
| **projects** | `/api/projects`, `/api/projects/<id>/assign`, `/api/projects/<id>/unassign` | CRUD projects, manage role assignments |
| **worklogs** | `/api/worklogs`, `/api/worklogs/<id>` | CRUD daily work entries |
| **users** | `/api/users`, `/api/users/<id>/role` | User account management (admin only) |
| **exports** | `/api/export/excel`, `/api/export/excel/bulk` | Generate Excel reports with styling |
| **core** | `/`, `/api/me`, `/api/dashboard` | Main page, auth check, dashboard data |
| **files** | `/api/files/tree`, `/api/files/folder[/<id>]`, `/api/files/upload`, `/api/files/<id>/download`, `/api/files/<id>`, `/api/files/stats` | Folder tree, CRUD folders, upload/download/delete files, storage usage snapshot |

